  "engine": "wavetable",
  "comment": "A house loop set up for the performance pads (Effects mode, Pads): stutter on sixteenths, a one-bar tape stop, a low-pass sweep over two bars and a reverb freeze, all on the beat. While the sweep closes, the pad opens its own filter against it; while any pad is held the plucks step back. Press Play, then hold the pads.",
